WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.701 --> 00:00:09.934
Auto follow-ups are messages your bot sends by itself, on a timer, to people who start it.

2
00:00:10.234 --> 00:00:13.193
Give it a name, and pick the bot that sends it.

3
00:00:14.035 --> 00:00:16.119
Then choose what starts it.

4
00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:20.829
Someone starts your bot, opens one of your start links, or gets a tag.

5
00:00:21.128 --> 00:00:25.292
This one is only for people who came from my Meta ad start link.

6
00:00:25.592 --> 00:00:27.511
Write the first message.

7
00:00:27.641 --> 00:00:30.205
Add their name, so it feels personal.

8
00:00:30.335 --> 00:00:32.248
It goes out right away.

9
00:00:32.548 --> 00:00:35.197
Add another message, and set the wait.

10
00:00:35.327 --> 00:00:37.710
This one goes out one day later.

11
00:00:41.191 --> 00:00:45.771
Every message can have a photo or video, and buttons with tracked links.

12
00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:47.450
In a hurry?

13
00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:51.467
Let Cas, the AI helper, write the whole sequence for you.

14
00:00:51.767 --> 00:00:54.038
Make sure it's on, then save.

15
00:00:54.168 --> 00:01:00.097
From now on, everyone who starts your bot from that link gets these messages, one by one.

16
00:01:00.396 --> 00:01:03.781
Welcoming people who ask to join a channel or group?

17
00:01:03.911 --> 00:01:06.054
Use Welcome Flows for that.
